// Object, Static Archive, LTO & Semantic Package Container Sections (`.axmeta`, `.axlto`, `.axmir`, `.axpkg`),
// Schema-Versioned Reader/Writer, COFF `.obj`/`.lib` Embedding, Link-Time Verification,
// Cross-Module LTO Verified MIR Consumption, and PE32+ `.exe`/`.dll` Section Stripping (T766 / E18.4).
// Implements SPEC-24 sec.1-sec.4 (AXS-ART-020..024, AXS-ART-050..053, INV-ART-002).
